# Cloudflare Pages security headers for the STATIC origin (direct *.pages.dev
# and PR previews that bypass the worker proxy). Copied verbatim into the build
# output. The wildcard *.nido.fyi production traffic goes through
# frontend/worker-proxy-nido/index.js, which sets the SAME headers; keep the two
# in sync. Enforced: frame/content-type/referrer. CSP is Report-Only (never
# blocks) until the report stream is verified clean in prod, then promote to
# Content-Security-Policy (drop -Report-Only) in BOTH places. See docs/MAINNET_READINESS.md.
# MAINNET CUTOVER: the connect-src Stellar hosts below are TESTNET
# (soroban-testnet/horizon-testnet/friendbot) — swap to soroban.stellar.org +
# horizon.stellar.org and remove friendbot at cutover, in BOTH places.
# HSTS covers every subdomain: the storage bridge and the setup cookie trust
# *.nido.fyi, so none of it may be reachable over plain http.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com; img-src 'self' data:; font-src 'self' data: https://fonts.gstatic.com; connect-src 'self' https://*.nido.fyi https://nido.fly.dev https://soroban-testnet.stellar.org https://horizon-testnet.stellar.org https://friendbot.stellar.org https://api.refractor.space https://api.soroswap.finance; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'; form-action 'self'

# The storage bridge is the one page meant to be framed: account and name
# origins embed it to share the account list. Detach the site-wide framing
# denial and report-only policy, and enforce a policy of its own that admits
# only *.nido.fyi ancestors over https. The page's own message handler
# narrows that further (account and name labels only, no built-in dApps).
# Keep in sync with frontend/worker-proxy-nido/index.js.
/nido-storage-bridge/
  ! X-Frame-Options
  ! Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'none'; script-src 'self'; frame-ancestors https://*.nido.fyi; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'
